### Cake Platform API - Subscription & Payment Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/owner
@authUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/auth

### =========================================
### 0. Authenticate to get Token
### =========================================
# @name loginUser
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "owner@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store the token from the login response
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.$.token}}

### =========================================
### 1. View Current Subscription (Should be empty if PENDING)
### =========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================
### 2. Simulate Payment to Activate Shop
### =========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/mock-checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1499.00
}

### =========================================
### 3. View Current Subscription Again (Should now be ACTIVE)
### =========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
